Peter;

	If I understand your question correctly; the answer is "Yes"
they all do.  The HSZ40, SWXRC, HSZ50, HSZ70 raid arrays let you 
configure RAID0 thru 5 (mirrors, stripes, RAID3,5, JBOD, passthru) and
present them to the scsi bus as a unit (some target/lun combination).
