}I've seen this on a lot of third party tape drives which ran fine under VMS 
}5.x.  Some change in VMS 6.x was not expected by the (often reverse engineered)
}controller.  The only solution we ever found was to replace the drive and
}controller (the controller for a DAT drive is probably built in).
