   Error A is a combination error 2 and error 8.  These are related to
interlock switches not being made.  On the development drawer, clean the 2
metal posts that mate to a couple holes in the printer frame.  Do the same
thing with the posts on the side door.  You can use a pencil eraser to clean
them at the tips.

   Make sure the top exit door is all the way down and that the spring loaded
latch is functioning on both sides.  The plastic may be broken on one side.
If so, melt a hole in the remaining plastic with a paper clip.  Insert the
spring in the new hole.

  Hope that helps. . .


