You say Thick Wire but you mean AUI. Thick Wire ethernet is in fact a
thick coaxial cable, not the multi cable connection you have from the AUI
port.

Your problem is that the AUI fuse is blown. This is located on the board
if memory serves me correctly, but it could be on the bulkhead connector
right beside the AUI port.

