Incredible that this comes up again for others ... I had a call about
this early last week.

The 2K I/O page is a function of a specific MSV-11 memory card.  Can't
remember which flavour at the moment.

RT-11 from what I can gather will *detect* and *use* a 2K I/O page, but
you can't use RT to set a 2K I/O page as if it were a software
selectable option.  There is a patch to disable a detected 2K I/O page
in the SYSGEN Book.

Stuart



