        Nope, that was not what I was talking about. :-)  Yes, I did see
    the Three Faces of TurboLaser, but I _also_ watched an active Galaxy
    running three instances of VMS  (or  it  could  have been two, but I
    thought  it  was three...that's a detail).  And this is what  I  was
    responding to Andreas about.

> You will see this technology again. Picture, if you will, a 32 or 64-CPU
