There was a recent thread on osf-managers that summarized thusly:


There are a number of utilities that apparently solve this need.

1. A SVR4 package that comes on the associated products CD, contains
sar, fuser, truss, timex, fmli, svr4-printspooler etc. 

The packages are:
SVEADM410           installed  System Management Package (System V
Environment)
SVEBCP410            installed  Base Compatibility Package (System V
Environmen)
SVEDEV410            installed  Development Tools Package (System V
Environment)
SVEENV410            installed  Environment Setup files (System V
Environment)  
SVEMAN410            installed  Man Pages Package (System V Environment)
SVEPRINT410         Print Package (System V Environment)    

2. A number of people recommended trace 1.25. The source for this is
readily available from ftp
sites. (http://www.digital.com/misc/pub-domain-osf1.txt.html.)  This
may also be called alpha-trace.

3. strace (apparently not the streams trace package I have on my
system) is available from ftp sites (strace-3.1.0.1-du.tgz).



This last one is the one I did.  You can find it at

ftp://ftp.mindspring.com/users/ahobson/strace-3.1.0.1-du.tgz

