>also does any one have the jumpers setting ie SCSI ID, TERM, PARITY


If it has a 5 pin power plug it's a RF35-DSSI drive, 850 MB.

This is NOT a SCSI drive and will NOT work on a SCSI bus. It's a DSSI Drive
and has no use in a PC.

The only directly supported platforms are the VAX4000, some MicroVAX 3xxx
and some BIG drive cabinets for the VAX6000 Series.

Chris






