The 3000/300 (and 300LX) stations, like the one I'm typing on now, are
TurboChannel based systems, and NT does not support them.  So that's not 
possible.

I think all the Alphastations series will run NT.  Back up all your disks
(maybe to some other system that runs FTP and can store them in some
more-or-less architecture-neutral format, like ZIP; otherwise you'll have to
find tar for NT), see if you can boot the ARC console, install NT, and don't
be surprised when Disk Administrator clobbers all your existing data after 
telling you it wants to write a harmless signature on the disks.

