|>Does anybody know how to disable the internal termination on the SCSI bus
|>and make my external port available?  I assume there is some command I have
|>to type at the console prompt, but I don't know what it is (if you'll recall
|>from my previous postings, I don't have any manuals.  When I started working
|>here a few months ago I inhereted these systems and the documents are
