And I wouldn't have to guess what you'd set the CSR's and Vectors to
if you'd actually answer my questions.  You see, a DHV11 has a different
CSR and Vector depending on what else is in the system:

$ mcr sysgen
SYSGEN>  CONFIG
DEVICE> uda 1
DEVICE> dhv11 1
DEVICE>  Exit
Device: UDA     Name: PUA        CSR: 772150     Vector: 154    Support: yes
Device: DHV11   Name: TXA        CSR: 760440*    Vector: 300*   Support: yes
SYSGEN>  CONFIG
DEVICE> uda 2
DEVICE> dhv11 1
DEVICE>  Exit
Device: UDA     Name: PUA        CSR: 772150     Vector: 154    Support: yes
Device: UDA     Name: PUB        CSR: 760334*    Vector: 300*   Support: yes
Device: DHV11   Name: TXA        CSR: 760500*    Vector: 310*   Support: yes

So - as you see - when I ask you questions, I'm not asking them to
make idle chatter.  I'm asking them because I CAN'T SOLVE YOUR PROBLEM
UNTIL YOU ANSWER THEM!!!

So, again:

1.  What sort of backplane?

2.  What cards are in the backplane?

3.  What are their CSR's and Vectors set to?

