update for Word 97 for Alpha. First place they send me too via Web
Browser, Office 98 for Macintosh. This burned my sensibilities. Yes I was
using my Macintosh to investiagte their site for PC/Alpha solutions and
they had the gall to send me to a place announcing VapourWare, not only
that, they've decided not to support my 68040 machine, just the PowerPC
Macintosh.
